# PATTERN 5: HUMAN INTERACTION
# Instance IDs come from the expense ID, and Azurite keeps history between runs,
# so change the ids to re-run a scenario.

# URL and keys come from http-client.env.json. Local values are the default; to test the deployed app, choose azure at the top right of this editor.

### 1. At or under the limit (5,000 from local.settings.json) → "AutoApproved", no waiting
POST {{baseUrl}}/expenses
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "exp-101",
  "employeeId": "emp-1",
  "managerId": "mgr-9",
  "amount": 420,
  "description": "Team lunch"
}

### 2. Over the limit, with a 2-minute approval window for the demo (production: 72 hours)
POST {{baseUrl}}/expenses?timeoutSeconds=120
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "exp-102",
  "employeeId": "emp-1",
  "managerId": "mgr-9",
  "amount": 7200,
  "description": "Conference travel"
}

### 3. The wrong person tries to approve → 403. The orchestration never sees it.
POST {{baseUrl}}/expenses/exp-102/decision
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approved": true,
  "approverId": "emp-1",
  "comment": "Approving my own expense"
}

### 4. The manager approves inside the window → "Approved". It completes now because the timer was cancelled.
POST {{baseUrl}}/expenses/exp-102/decision
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approved": true,
  "approverId": "mgr-9",
  "comment": "Budgeted in Q4"
}

### 5. Status / output of exp-102
GET {{hostUrl}}/runtime/webhooks/durabletask/instances/expense-exp-102?code={{systemKey}}

### 6. Timeout path: 30-second window and nobody answers → "Escalated"
POST {{baseUrl}}/expenses?timeoutSeconds=30
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "exp-103",
  "employeeId": "emp-2",
  "managerId": "mgr-9",
  "amount": 12500,
  "description": "New laptops"
}

### 7. Check exp-103 after 30 seconds
GET {{hostUrl}}/runtime/webhooks/durabletask/instances/expense-exp-103?code={{systemKey}}
